        who: "<strong>Maya</strong> asks. <strong>Sheepdog Tracking</strong> plans it, <strong>QA</strong> tests consent, <strong>Toby</strong> reviews.",
        thread: "c",
        day: "Wednesday 4 November",
        parent: {
          who: "maya",
          time: "15:05",
          html: "<p>Can you add the Meta pixel and track when people send the contact form? Our agency wants to start Instagram ads next week.</p>",
        },
        steps: [
